WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Hi there! Meet DeepsComply360 — a calm, clear way to manage compliance and governance.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Register your organisation and pick the frameworks you follow, then record every obligation with an owner and a due date.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Map the controls and policies that satisfy those obligations, so nothing gets missed.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Score your risks by likelihood and impact, and watch your compliance score and audit readiness update as you work.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Every action is kept in an immutable audit trail, and you can share a read-only view with regulators and auditors.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
DeepsComply360 — built for PNG and the Pacific by Deeps Systems. Everything here is demo data.
